description	"Zuckuss

A hunter focused on disruption.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Gand Shockprod Staff (Staff/Purple Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Shocks/tracks on hit
-- 105% more knockback
-- 16/33% shorter
- GRS-1 Snare Rifle (DEMP2 1)
-- Shocks/freezes/staggers/drains on hit
-- Unblockable
-- 65% faster RoF
-- 350% more FP drain
-- 4400% slower reload
- Ammonia Bombs (2/5) (Flechette 4)
-- Poisons/tracks/slows on det
-- 75% more damage
-- Secondary fire only
- W-90 Concussion Rifle (T-21 1)
-- Pushes on hit
-- 20% faster RoF
-- 10% more damage
-- 75% more FP drain
- Trip Mine (3)
-- Disarms on det

^8Attributes:
- Getup (3)
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Healing (2)
- Findsman Precognition (Miraluka 1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Force Block (3)
- Respirator (Underwater Breathing)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]"